Down the horizon from [[Hallia]]'s central districts, Starward was thrown up in anticipation of a tram-line boom that never arrived — and the decades since have done nothing for the half-finished facades left waiting. It shows in the grime, the sagging gutters, the general air of a neighbourhood still standing in for a future that turned out to be a lie.
